00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.620
Congratulations on making
it to the end of the course.

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:08.380
I hope you enjoyed building a
Knowledge Graph powered RAG system

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.240
and exploring the details
of SEC financial documents.

4
00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:14.310
Public records like these
are definitely more fun

5
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.699
to analyze when you can
chat directly with them.

6
00:00:17.719 --> 00:00:22.460
The SEC example you worked through in
this course is representative of the kinds of

7
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.940
applications that companies are building
with Knowledge Graphs and generative AI.

8
00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:29.420
I hope the course has inspired you
to build your own Knowledge Graphs.

9
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.799
If you'd like to continue your learning,

10
00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:35.439
there are a lot of
resources on the Neo4j website.

11
00:00:36.219 --> 00:00:39.829
There, you can sign up for a free
cloud-hosted Neo4j account and learn

12
00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:42.600
about other tools that can help
you craft your own Knowledge Graphs.

13
00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.289
Thank you for sticking with
me to the end of the course,

14
00:00:46.289 --> 00:00:47.820
and I can't wait to see what you build.